==Swedish==

===Pronunciation===
*{{audio|Sv-på.ogg|audio}}

===Preposition===
'''på'''

# [[on]]; touching from above
#: ''Boken ligger '''på''' bordet'' = ''The book lies on the table''
# [[touching]], hanging from or being attached to (a vertical surface)
#: ''Äpplet som hänger '''på''' den grenen'' = ''The apple hanging on that branch''
#: ''Skylten '''på''' väggen'' = ''The sign on the wall''
# on a certain day
#: '''''på''' julafton'' = ''on Christmas eve''

=====Usage notes=====
''På'' is only used in the time sense when speaking of days when describing them in some sense: ''på julafton'', ''på min födelsedag'', ''på måndag''; when giving a date this preposition is excluded: ''Han köpte bilen den tredje maj'' = ''He bought the car on the third of May''

=====Synonyms====
*[[å#Swedish|å]] (''archaic'')

===Adjective===
'''på'''

# [[turned on]] (''about machines or similar''); [[functioning]]

